{"boundary_iou__is__more_sensitive_than_the_standard_mask_iou_measure_to_boundary_errors_for_large_objects": "The phrase \"is more sensitive than\" describes the relationship between Boundary IoU and the standard Mask IoU measure, indicating that Boundary IoU reacts more strongly to certain types of errors, particularly those related to the boundaries of large objects."},
{"more_sensitive_than_the_standard_mask_iou_measure_to_boundary_errors_for_large_objects": "The standard Mask IoU measure is a commonly used evaluation metric for segmentation tasks that calculates the overlap between the predicted segmentation mask and the ground truth mask. It is less sensitive to boundary errors, especially for large objects, compared to Boundary IoU."},
