{"97": "97% represents the Mask IoU value, indicating that the predicted object masks overlap with the ground truth masks by 97%, which is a strong indicator of the model's precise object detection capabilities."},
{"boundary_iou__is__69": "The predicate \"is\" signifies the value or measurement associated with the Boundary IoU metric. In this context, it indicates the specific percentage value that the Boundary IoU has achieved."},
