{"impressive_86_relative_improvement_in_ap": "The object, \"impressive 86% relative improvement in AP,\" describes a notable enhancement in Average Precision (AP), a common evaluation metric in computer vision tasks. This improvement signifies a substantial advancement in the performance or accuracy of instance segmentation techniques."},
