{"a_boundary_based_segmentation_measure": "A boundary-based segmentation measure refers to a method that evaluates the accuracy of image segmentation by focusing on the boundaries or contours of segmented regions. Trimap IoU, as a boundary-based measure, specifically calculates the intersection over union within a narrow band of pixels around the contour of the ground truth mask."},
