{"both_measures_in_detail": "Both measures in detail refers to a thorough examination of two specific evaluation metrics\u2014Trimap and F-measure\u2014that are used to assess boundary quality in semantic segmentation tasks."},
{"the_next_section__will_analyze__their_behavior_across_different_error_types_and_object_sizes": "The phrase \"will analyze\" indicates a forthcoming detailed examination and assessment of specific aspects, in this case, the behavior of certain measures in semantic segmentation."},
{"their_behavior_across_different_error_types_and_object_sizes": "Their behavior across different error types and object sizes pertains to how the measures of Trimap and F-measure perform or vary under various conditions of errors and with objects of different sizes in semantic segmentation tasks."},
