{"higher_score_under_a_fixed_error_severity": "A higher score under a fixed error severity means that despite a consistent level of error or inaccuracy, the pseudo-predictions for larger objects are awarded a greater numerical value or ranking, suggesting they are favored or considered more significant in some way."},
{"dilation_erosion_pixels": "Dilation/erosion (pixels) refers to a morphological operation in image processing where pixels are either expanded (dilation) or contracted (erosion) to modify the shape of objects within an image."},
