{"coco_val_set": "The COCO val set is a validation dataset from the COCO (Common Objects in Context) dataset, which is widely used for evaluating instance segmentation models. It contains a variety of images with annotations for objects, allowing for the assessment of how well models can segment and identify objects within these images."},
