{"the_boundary_quality_of_large_objects": "The boundary quality of large objects refers to how accurately and precisely the edges of larger objects are detected and delineated by an object detection model. High boundary quality implies that the model can correctly identify and segment the edges of large objects, which is critical for applications requiring detailed object recognition."},
