{"mask_r_cnn_with_several_backbones": "Mask R-CNN with several backbones refers to the Mask R-CNN model, which is a popular framework for instance segmentation, combined with different backbone networks such as ResNet-50, ResNet-101, and ResNeXt-101-32 \u00d7 8d. These backbones are used to extract features from input images, which are then utilized by the Mask R-CNN to perform segmentation, categorization, and localization tasks."},
