{"boundary_iou__allows__a_more_granular_analysis_of_segmentation_related_errors_for_complex_tasks_like_instance_and_panoptic_segmentation": "The predicate \"allows\" indicates that Boundary IoU facilitates or enables a certain capability or feature, in this case, a more detailed and nuanced examination of errors in segmentation tasks."},
