{"an_algorithm_to_delineate_objects_with_pixel_level_binary_masks": "An algorithm to delineate objects with pixel-level binary masks is a sophisticated computational method designed to accurately segment and identify individual objects within an image. This algorithm produces a binary mask for each object, where each pixel is classified as either belonging to an object or not, enabling precise object boundaries and recognition."},
