{"iou_in_a_narrow_band_of_pixels_within_a_pixel_distance_d_from_the_contour_of_the_ground_truth_mask": "The object \"IoU in a narrow band of pixels within a pixel distance _d_ from the contour of the ground truth mask\" describes the specific region where the IoU is calculated. This region is a narrow band of pixels around the contour of the ground truth mask, defined by a pixel distance _d_, which helps in assessing the precision of segmentations near object boundaries."},
