{"the_behavior_of_these_measures": "The object 'the behavior of these measures' refers to the specific characteristics and responses of the mask consistency measures under examination. These measures are being evaluated based on how their values change in response to varying magnitudes of errors, as part of the sensitivity analysis methodology."},
