{"any_errors_outside_of_the_ground_truth_boundary_region": "Any errors outside of the ground truth boundary region refers to discrepancies between the predicted mask and the actual mask that occur outside the specified boundary area, which the Trimap IoU metric does not penalize."},
{"the_measure__penalizes__inner_mask_errors_less_than_mask_iou": "Penalizes indicates that the measure applies a form of punishment or reduction in score to certain types of errors, specifically those that occur within the mask."},
