{"mask_pixels__are_highlighted_if__within_distance_d_from_the_contours": "The phrase \"are highlighted if\" indicates a conditional action where certain pixels are visually distinguished or marked under specific circumstances. In this case, the condition is based on the spatial relationship of the pixels to the contours of the objects within the mask."},
