{"boundary_iou__computes__intersection_over_union_between_highlighted_regions": "The predicate 'computes' indicates the action performed by Boundary IoU, which is to calculate a specific value based on the comparison between two sets of data\u2014in this case, the highlighted regions of ground truth and prediction masks."},
{"intersection_over_union_between_highlighted_regions": "The intersection-over-union between highlighted regions refers to the ratio of the overlapping area to the combined area of the highlighted regions in both the ground truth and prediction masks. This metric quantifies how well the predicted boundaries match the actual boundaries."},
