{"a_broad_range_of_evaluation_metrics": "A broad range of evaluation metrics refers to the diverse set of quantitative measures used to assess the performance of segmentation algorithms. These metrics can include accuracy, precision, recall, F1 score, and others, each providing different insights into the effectiveness of the segmentation process."},
