{"improvements_to_boundary_segmentations": "Improvements to boundary segmentations refer to enhancements in the accuracy and precision of the edges or boundaries of segmented objects. These improvements are crucial for applications where fine-grained object delineation is important, such as in medical imaging or autonomous driving. However, the use of Mask IoU may not incentivize such improvements due to its inherent biases."},
