{"expert_annotations_for_images_in_coco_and_ade20k_datasets": "Expert annotations for images in COCO and ADE20k datasets refer to detailed, precise markings or labels added to images by skilled annotators. These annotations are critical for training and evaluating machine learning models, especially in tasks like object detection, segmentation, and instance segmentation. The COCO and ADE20k datasets are well-known repositories of images used extensively in computer vision research."},
