{"a_perfect_score_to_non_identical_masks": "A perfect score to non-identical masks refers to the scenario where the Boundary IoU metric gives its highest possible score to masks that, while not being identical in shape or area, have boundaries that align within a specified distance _d_, thus satisfying the conditions of the Boundary IoU evaluation."},
