{"non_matching_pixels_of_the_disc_shaped_mask__are__further_than_d_pixels_away_from_its_boundary": "The predicate \"are\" signifies the state or condition of the non-matching pixels of the disc-shaped mask in relation to their distance from the boundary of the mask."},
{"further_than_d_pixels_away_from_its_boundary": "The object \"further than _d_ pixels away from its boundary\" describes the specific condition or state of the non-matching pixels, indicating that they are located at a distance greater than _d_ pixels from the boundary of the disc-shaped mask."},
