{"experiments_on_cityscapes_and_lvis": "The experiments on Cityscapes and LVIS are additional tests conducted to validate the findings from the COCO dataset comparison. Cityscapes is a dataset for semantic understanding of urban street scenes, while LVIS is a dataset with a long-tail distribution of objects, providing a broader context for the evaluation of instance segmentation methods."},
