{"the_supplement": "The supplement is an additional document or section that contains detailed descriptions of the datasets used in the experiments, as well as the evaluation results for different models.|Here is another description: The supplement is an additional document or section that provides extra information and details that complement the main text. In this context, it contains the detailed description of the datasets and the Boundary AP evaluation results for the models on the three datasets."},
{"detailed_description": "The detailed description refers to comprehensive information about the datasets used in the experiments, including COCO, Cityscapes, and LVIS. It also includes the evaluation metrics and results for Boundary AP across various models."},
