{"boundary_ap_evaluation__is_provided_for__various_recent_and_classic_models": "The phrase \"is provided for\" indicates that Boundary AP evaluation results are made available or presented for a specific set of models. This suggests that the evaluation has been conducted and the outcomes are being offered for review or comparison."},
{"various_recent_and_classic_models": "Various recent and classic models refer to a diverse set of instance segmentation algorithms that have been developed over time. These models include both state-of-the-art approaches and well-established methods that have been widely used in the field."},
