{"results__can_be_used_as__a_reference": "The phrase \"can be used as\" indicates a utility or function that the results provide. In this context, it suggests that the results serve a practical purpose for future research or methods, offering a benchmark or standard against which new approaches can be measured."},
{"a_reference": "A reference in this context is a standard or point of comparison that future methods can use to evaluate their performance. The results, when used as a reference, simplify the process of comparing new methods with existing ones, providing a clear and consistent baseline."},
