{"models": "The subject refers to various models that are being compared in the context of instance segmentation tasks. These models are evaluated based on their performance metrics such as Mask AP and Boundary AP.|Here is another description: The subject, \"Models,\" refers to various instance segmentation models that are being evaluated and compared in the context of the COCO validation set.|Here is another description: The object 'models' represents the different algorithms or systems that are being evaluated for their segmentation quality. These models are the subjects of comparison in the context of segmentation performance."},
